<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the French</p>
<p>first division after Wednesday's matches:</p>
<p>19 - David Zitelli (Strasbourg), Stephane Guivarc'h (Rennes)</p>
<p>18 - Japhet N'Doram (Nantes)</p>
<p>17 - Sonny Anderson (Monaco)</p>
<p>16 - Alain Caveglia (Lyon), Anto Drobnjak (Bastia)</p>
<p>13 - Ibrahim Bakayoko (Montpellier), Xavier Gravelaine</p>
<p>(Marseille)</p>
<p>12 - Jean-Piere Papin (Bordeaux)</p>
<p>11 - Miladin Becanovic (Lille), Victor Ikpeba (Monaco), Patrice</p>
<p>Loko</p>
<p>(Paris St Germain)</p>
